d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"修竹栏 其二","author":"王佐（汝学","text":"老去看花兴亦偏，独怜春色异当年。\n无端浪与花为主，合作青皇管局仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51527,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"食馀甘","author":"王佐（汝学","text":"甘随苦后知何似，不独馀甘橄榄同。\n版筑岩间商辅相，钓鱼城下汉英雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51528,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荆王太子墓","author":"王佐（汝学","text":"起辇苔深天地荒，黄沙白草正茫茫。\n诸陵亦在黄沙里，未必朱耶是瘴乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51529,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹧鸪媒 其一","author":"王佐（汝学","text":"傍母群雏记往年，粒呼虫与自相怜。\n一从锢养金笼里，骨肉相看不似前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51530,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹧鸪媒 其二","author":"王佐（汝学","text":"世路无端多网罗，声声何苦叫哥哥。\n哥哥若不争雄长，叫破春风也奈何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51531,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和曾双溪南园唱和谣二首 其一 唱","author":"王佐（汝学","text":"花落香残恐后时，寻芳何事苦来迟。\n春风独有花心苦，尽说当年杜牧知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51532,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和曾双溪南园唱和谣二首 其二 和","author":"王佐（汝学","text":"杜牧寻春春已迟，可怜偏恋折残枝。\n春丛亦有含花死，豆蔻丁香牧未知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51533,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"含笑花 其一","author":"王佐（汝学","text":"尧草元能指佞臣，逢花休问笑何人。\n君看青史千年笑，奚止山花笑一春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51534,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"含笑花 其二","author":"王佐（汝学","text":"白白红红竞好春，含香羞涩似含颦。\n无端却被崖州户，错怪山花解笑人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51535,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秦吉了并序","author":"王佐（汝学","text":"口呼万岁祝千秋，羌女金笼占上流。\n若到上阳供奉日，陇山鹦鹉尽回头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51536,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]